      en: ["The site has been a UNESCO World Heritage Site since 1985.", "There are more than 3,000 individual carvings located in Hjemmeluft alone.", "The earliest carvings date back to approximately 4200 BC.", "Common motifs include reindeer hunts, bears, fish, and prehistoric boats.", "Post-glacial land uplift pushed the older carvings higher up the hillside.", "The rock carvings were only rediscovered by chance in the year 1973."],
