      en: ["The 1904 fire destroyed approximately 850 buildings in just 16 hours.", "Kaiser Wilhelm II sent four ships loaded with aid materials to the city.", "The reconstruction was largely completed between 1904 and 1907.", "Around 800 Art Nouveau buildings characterize the current cityscape.", "Ålesund is a member of the Reseau Art Nouveau Network of the Council of Europe.", "The Jugendstilsenteret opened in 2003 in the former Swan Pharmacy building."],
